==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:A Beautiful Friendship]] in order to do [[Quest:Ka-Boom or Not To Boom]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Help Rizzle get his beauty sleep by defeating Robgoblin Kaboomers in Sunstone Valley.
*Defeat Robgoblin Kaboomers - /10
*Return to Rizzle
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Uuugh. How is a robgoblin supposed to get ANY sleep with all that racket!<br />Night and day, Fizzbang’s lackeys just KABOOM this, or KABOOM that! Honestly, <Player Name>, if you could <font color='#D9781A'>stop those Robgoblin Kaboomers</font> it would literally be the greatest thing ever." -Rizzle
#Defeat Robgoblin Kaboomers - /10
#*[[Robgoblin Kaboomer]]s are located all around the areas outside of [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#Speak with [[Rizzle]] located in [[Whirly's Scrap Camp]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"<nowiki>*snore*</nowiki><br /><nowiki>*snore*</nowiki><br />Huh, what... OH! <Player Name>!<br />It’s a good thing you’re back, because I have a whole new problem to deal with!" -Rizzle

